<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  RUST_CATHEDRAL_MECHANICS_1 §3 — the bolt-shed curiosity. Dropped by
  RUT_LivingBolt's vanilla CompSpawner every 4-8 days (see that def).

  ParentName="ResourceBase" follows the same precedent RUT_CathedralRoachShell
  and RUT_FungalSoil use in this repo.

  INVENTED parameter (kit spec §3's own line): curiosity value ~40, set as
  MarketValue below. Salable is the point - the sheet's "bolt-shed curiosities
  and eel-catch - both salable, both watched."

  WATCHED: picking one up costs the Cathedral's patience. That wiring is
  entirely in C# (Source/HarmonyPatch_WatchedBolts.cs) and deliberately does
  NOT appear in this file: a comp or a tag here would show in the info card,
  and the sheet's ban 1 forbids the def telling the player it is watched.

  REGISTER: §P only. The description says what the thing IS and what a
  trader thinks of it. It does not say where it comes from beyond the
  observable, does not name the hum, and does not hint that carrying it is
  noticed.

  ART: placeholder - reuses vanilla ComponentIndustrial's icon path as a
  stand-in until the art pipe gives this its own sprite. Same convention
  RUT_CathedralRoachShell used.
-->
<Defs>

  <ThingDef ParentName="ResourceBase">
    <defName>RUT_BoltShedCuriosity</defName>
    <label>shed curiosity</label>
    <description>A small bright object left behind on ground where the bolts have been dancing. It is machined - too well machined - and it is not a part of anything anyone can name. Turn it over and the facets do not quite line up the way facets should. Off-world buyers pay well for one and ask no questions, which is its own kind of answer.</description>
    <thingCategories>
      <li>ResourcesRaw</li>
    </thingCategories>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>Things/Item/Resource/ComponentIndustrial</texPath>
      <graphicClass>Graphic_StackCount</graphicClass>
    </graphicData>
    <stackLimit>25</stackLimit>
    <statBases>
      <MarketValue>40</MarketValue>
      <Mass>0.1</Mass>
      <Beauty>2</Beauty>
      <Flammability>0</Flammability>
    </statBases>
    <alwaysHaulable>true</alwaysHaulable>
    <resourceReadoutPriority>Middle</resourceReadoutPriority>
    <tradeTags>
      <li>ExoticMisc</li>
    </tradeTags>
  </ThingDef>

</Defs>
